  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">"Published in conjunction with an installation of the same title"--Colophon</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">The installation toured the UK from November 22-December 22, 1996, then joined the touring exhibition "Artist/Author: Contemporary Artists' Books", for which the installation was originally commissioned, exhibiting at six locations in the US from February 8, 1998-December 18, 1999</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">"The projected images produced by the artists all contain texts, generated using different media"--P. [7]-[8]</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Consists of images of 12 artists' work for a traveling exhibition</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="505" ind1="0" ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Contents: Untitled / Simon Patterson -- Untitled / Douglas Gordon -- Ibuka! anoucement, Stuttgart 1995 / Liam Gillick -- Conversation / Tracy Mackenna -- Disappearance at sea / Tacita Dean -- Untitled / Joseph Kosuth -- Mutate and grow / Judith Barry, text by Brad Miskell -- Panorama Island, slide stencil / Angela Bulloch -- I need art like I need God / Tracey Emin -- Untitled / Susan Hiller -- Jimmie Durham / Jimmie Durham -- Comment, doesn't matter / Robert Barry</subfield>
  </datafield>
